{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41791","headline":"飞龙引 · 陈陶","name":"飞龙引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长洲茂苑朝夕池，映日含风结细漪。\n坐当伏槛红莲披，雕轩洞户青苹吹。\n轻幌芳烟郁金馥，绮檐花簟桃李枝。\n苕苕翡翠但相逐，桂树鸳鸯恒并宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}